    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Trigger:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} is hit by an attack roll. <em>Response:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} halves the attack's damage to itself (round down), and it teleports to an unoccupied space it can see within 30 feet of itself. <em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=0wuU3cUgVxv7hYpY]], each creature within 5 feet of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s destination space. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn. While Poisoned, it has the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated apply=false] condition.</p>",
